<Base title="Namat Health — Waitlist privacy note" description="How Namat Health handles email addresses submitted to its waitlist." robots="noindex, follow" bodyClass="document-page"><header class="site-header"><Wordmark /><a href="/">Home</a></header><main id="main" class="document-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Waitlist privacy note · Effective 21 September 2026</p><h1>Your email. Your choice.</h1><p>This form is for expressing interest in Namat Health. It asks for your email address and your agreement to receive waitlist updates. Please do not submit health information.</p><h2>What happens when you submit</h2><p>The website sends your email address to Brevo to request email confirmation. You are added to the Namat waitlist after you follow the confirmation link. If the connection is unavailable, the form tells you and does not report a successful signup.</p><h2>What the website uses</h2><p>The site is hosted by Vercel. Brevo manages confirmation and the waitlist. The page does not install advertising or analytics tracking. Hosting and email services may process technical information required to provide their services.</p><h2>Change your mind</h2><p>You can use the unsubscribe link in any waitlist email. To withdraw your interest, request removal, or ask about the waitlist, contact <a href="mailto:borja@namat.health">borja@namat.health</a>.</p><a href="/">Return to Namat ↗</a></main></Base>
